english.TypeCompact=Compact installation (core only)
english.TypeCustom=Custom installation
english.ComponentVDDDesc=Creates and manages virtual displays for streaming, with SDR and HDR support. Optional when using a physical display. Imports an Foundation locally issued signing certificate into Trusted Root.
english.ComponentFirewallDesc=Allows Moonlight clients to discover and connect to this PC over the network.
english.ComponentAutostartDesc=Sunshine will start automatically when Windows boots. Recommended for always-on streaming.
english.ComponentGamepadDesc=Optional Xbox controller emulation for client gamepad input. Upstream maintenance has ended.
english.ComponentVmouseDesc=Optional: improves remote mouse input compatibility with some games. Basic mouse control works without it. Imports a test-signing certificate into Trusted Root and Trusted Publishers.
english.MsgDriverTrust=The selected optional drivers will add Foundation locally issued signing certificate to this computer's trust stores:%n%n%1%n%nThese certificates are not public certificate-authority endorsements. Continue only if you trust these driver publishers.%n%nContinue installing the selected drivers?
english.VDDTrust=ZakoVDD: Trusted Root Certification Authorities
english.VmouseTrust=Virtual Mouse: Trusted Root Certification Authorities and Trusted Publishers
english.ComponentToolsDesc=dxgi-info, audio-info for troubleshooting display and audio issues.
